  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.18 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Psychologists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.18 Jurisprudence Examination Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Psychologists. The fee for the jurisprudence exam for psychologists as regulated by the board of psychologists under RSA 329-B shall be $40.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.16)",
